From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Backport targeted Wine 11.18 fixes.

Squashed backport of 77 WineHQ commits first released in wine-11.18, applied in upstream
order on top of cx26.3-wine11.0-runeon.11 patches 0001-0106. Test-only hunks are omitted.
No production-code adaptation was needed; every commit applied without fuzz.

  a50748f6ba Esme Povirk: ole32: Fix offset update in propertystorage_read_scalar.
  5821f22093 Esme Povirk: ole32: Rewrite free loop on error path.
  e42cc66975 Esme Povirk: ole32: Handle failures in StgStreamImpl_CopyTo.
  b7bf171ee7 Esme Povirk: ole32: Use common error path.
  de7152e0a1 Esme Povirk: ole32: Check for read past end of stream.
  c00d4e54e4 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: NULL the out pointer for unsupported interfaces in ID3DXBuffer QueryInterface().
  d6486b89e9 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/effect: Fix object array element release.
  30a1714fb2 Matteo Bruni: d3d10: Compute dependent properties for all the state variables.
  15675d8486 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: Add missing error checks in wide string allocations.
  ef6c413c68 Nikolay Sivov: kernelbase: Partially implement PackageFullNameFromId().
  490f6d5dcb Andrey Gusev: d3dx: Check for NULL new_data in convert_dib_to_bmp().
  6f6f8cc2b2 Andrey Gusev: msi: Check for NULL prop,val in msi_parse_command_line().
  857fc25d9e Andrey Gusev: msi: Check for NULL t in append_storage_to_db().
  83567b4de8 Dmitry Timoshkov: crypt32: Properly encode CMSG_ENCODED_MESSAGE in the PKCS signed message decoder.
  5702075840 Nikolay Sivov: wined3d/spirv: Fix a typo in bitwise mask test.
  e8aab51af2 Paul Gofman: wined3d: Support vertex blending for position in process_vertices_strided().
  bd0f453b7b Paul Gofman: wined3d: Support vertex blending for lighting in process_vertices_strided().
  59c2487ec0 Hans Leidekker: msi: Validate localpath length in open_package().
  b12c118cd0 Hans Leidekker: msi: Handle NULL usersid/prodcode in get_deferred_action().
  737a2eaa65 Hans Leidekker: msi: Handle missing SourceDir property in change_media().
  95092a62b0 Hans Leidekker: msi: Check for allocation failure in MsiLoadStringA().
  1beecdbe81 Hans Leidekker: msi: Check the result of MSI_RecordGetString() in is_uninstallable().
  71a7b57f66 Hans Leidekker: msi: Check for allocation failure in marshal_record().
  ef8b61b1ff Hans Leidekker: msi: Check for MSI_CreateRecord() failure in ITERATE_FindRelatedProducts().
  98b5e601a7 Hans Leidekker: msi: Fix potential use-after-free in st_find_free_entry().
  5a88abc026 Hans Leidekker: msi: Fix memory leak on error in do_msidbCustomActionTypeDll().
  4c6b477ca8 Hans Leidekker: msi: Clean up on failure in MsiFormatRecordA().
  5a34ae548e Hans Leidekker: msi: Avoid underflow in MSI_GetUserInfo().
  7b48b54cc9 Hans Leidekker: msi: Avoid underflow in UPDATE_execute().
  2c838cdb31 Matteo Bruni: d3dx10: Add missing wide string allocation error check in D3DX10CreateAsyncFileLoaderA().
  231b1fc0c7 Matteo Bruni: d3dx11: Add missing wide string allocation error check in D3DX11CreateAsyncFileLoaderA().
  e7724a3733 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: Fix potential leak in OptimizeInplace()'s failure path.
  e5c55144a8 Matteo Bruni: d3d10: Add a comment for intentional behavior in pres_not() and pres_or().
  f4d8c9ac94 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: Fix sampler parameters release.
  cb426f518d Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: Free effect on creation failure.
  2bac3e145a Matteo Bruni: d3dx9: Always initialize effect output parameter in D3DXCreateEffect*().
  46040aba51 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Validate skin weights data more strictly.
  66d978c37c Vibhav Pant: vccorlib140/tests: Add tests for Platform::Object::Object().
  913e31f201 Vibhav Pant: vccorlib140: Implement Platform::Object::Object().
  5b7db73f17 Charlotte Pabst: winegstreamer: Read input in chunks of 256KiB.
  f360ce3e9b Nikolay Sivov: mfreadwrite: Fix end-of-segment notifications for MF_SINK_WRITER_ALL_STREAMS.
  4ce3be29b2 Nikolay Sivov: xmllite/writer: Improve failure handling in WriteRawChars().
  81b91d695a Alex Henrie: combase: Fix double free on error path in dispatch_rpc.
  eb4d67e498 Bernhard Übelacker: sechost: Avoid buffer-overlow with too short strings in ConvertStringSidToSid.
  0016dd69fa Nikolay Sivov: winegstreamer/aac: Fix a copy-paste mistake in SetOutputType().
  29ca3c9235 Nikolay Sivov: winegstreamer: Fix a copy-paste mistake in internal video type mapping helper.
  14947569cf Nikolay Sivov: winegstreamer: Fix typos in trace messages.
  43761b4f33 Sean Reid: winebus.sys: Truncate input reports to their declared length.
  dc64d49e35 Alex Henrie: setupapi: Fix "DelService" search in SetupInstallServicesFromInfSectionW.
  6879d807ca Nikolay Sivov: d2d1: Add Premultiply effect stub.
  82e6473430 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: oleaut32: Don't skip characters after 'c' in VarTokenizeFormatString.
  2cb6ba3b9d Dmitry Timoshkov: crypt32: Use public symbolic names.
  0ef68151e1 Vibhav Pant: vccorlib140: Use the correct prefix in IPrintable RTTI descriptors for exceptions.
  74e2da14e6 Tobiasz Laskowski: kernel32: Use upper case hex in temp files names.
  07e96fffeb Alex Henrie: dwrite: Correct interface name in warning in rendertarget_DrawGlyphRun.
  d22810d47b Esme Povirk: windowscodecs: Check for multiplication overflow in BMP decoder.
  62c9210ded Hans Leidekker: rsaenh: Handle get_key_container() failure in RSAENH_CPSetKeyParam().
  4426edc42a Hans Leidekker: ncrypt: Validate data parameter in NCryptImportKey().
  6d7d38deb9 Marc-Aurel Zent: imm32: Cancel IME composition on hkl deactivation.
  53a8bd07fc Alex Henrie: gdiplus: Fix typo in DLL name in comment above GdipAddPathArcI.
  f8b1ce3c42 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: oleaut32: Correctly compare the last character in VarFormatPercent.
  601c15ae64 Conor McCarthy: mf/clock: Don't notify a sink that is also the time source in AddClockStateSink().
  791fc577bb Conor McCarthy: mf/evr: Always send MEStreamSinkStopped in OnClockStop().
  d171c7f02e Conor McCarthy: mf/evr: Always send MEStreamSinkPaused in OnClockPaused().
  e69d5211d6 Conor McCarthy: mf/session: Ignore MEStreamSinkStopped if prerolling or starting sinks.
  69b6db4d63 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/effect: Validate parameter object id.
  33db24d0c5 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/effect: Downgrade OOB effect value traces from FIXME() to WARN().
  aece4f6315 Matteo Bruni: d3dx: Validate RLE-compressed TGA data more strictly.
  d015c25d4e Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Fix normal data size validation.
  f6f8f0b79e Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Don't overflow vertex declaration buffer in SetDeclaration().
  686123da83 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Don't overflow vertex declaration buffer in UpdateSemantics().
  9727d07d07 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Don't overflow vertex declaration buffer in D3DXCreateMesh().
  cee9e84782 Matteo Bruni: d3dx9/mesh: Add bounds checking in declaration_equals().
  8bedd937e5 Anton Baskanov: dmband: Handle GUID_Download and GUID_Unload.
  2dce08ea74 Anton Baskanov: dmime: Don't leak collection in midi_parser_parse().
  14f7c39e9b Anton Baskanov: dmusic: Allow downloading an instrument to multiple ports.
  a0e3d94ec3 Anton Baskanov: dmusic: Keep track of instrument download count.

